id: flash-reacted
section: The suite's own
item: A reacted check against a no-input control: a planted frozen movie and a looping animation that ignores input are reported as not reacting, a movie that reacts as reacting
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-plant-frozen.swf
kit: cavekit-flash.md R2
wait rect m 30
wait still m 8
flash-control m 4
dismiss 200 250
expect flash-reacted m 4 no
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-plant-loop.swf
wait rect m 10
flash-control m 5
dismiss 200 250
expect flash-reacted m 5 no
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-plant-reacts.swf
wait rect m 10
wait still m 8
flash-control m 3
dismiss 200 250
expect flash-reacted m 3 yes
